# api call for  create user account
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/cinema/user/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user",
    "email":"user@gmail.com",
    "password":"user@123",
    "phone":9876546756
    
}

# api call for token in user
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/cinema/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user",
    "password":"user@123"
}


